<div class="titleband" data-screen-label="FAQ — title"><h1><span class="u-1">FAQ</span></h1></div>
<div class="u-46 introband">
  <h2>Straight answers.</h2>
  <p>No spin, no hedging where we can help it. If a question isn&rsquo;t here, <a class="u-1" href="/contact/">ask us</a> — we&rsquo;ll add it.</p>
